{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09314","headline":"登西南冈卜居遇雨寻竹浪至沣壖萦带数里清流茂树云物可赏 · 韦应物","name":"登西南冈卜居遇雨寻竹浪至沣壖萦带数里清流茂树云物可赏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登高创危构，林表见川流。\n微雨飒已至，萧条川气秋。\n下寻密竹尽，忽旷沙际游。\n纡曲水分野，绵延稼盈畴。\n寒花明废墟，樵牧笑榛丘。\n云水成阴澹，竹树更清幽。\n适自恋佳赏，复兹永日留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}